- * 3. POST to Sicoob chat-bridge (/functions/v1/chat-bridge) with:
- *    - Bearer token: bridgeSecret
- *    - Payload: action, contact_id, message_id, agent_id, agent_name, content, Sicoob IDs
- *    - 15s timeout window (AbortSignal)
